Create a high-fidelity LOGIN & REGISTRATION module for a Smart India Hackathon 2026 project called:

KISANQ

Tagline:
"Smart Procurement. Better Predictability."

Problem Statement ID:
SIH26032

Problem Statement:
Digital Farmer Slot Booking and Tracking Platform

IMPORTANT:
The project name is KISANQ.
Do NOT use the old name "KisanSetu" anywhere in the design.

This is the FARMER AUTHENTICATION module of the KisanQ prototype.

Create:

1. Farmer Login Page
2. OTP Verification Page
3. Farmer Registration Page
4. Registration OTP Verification Page
5. Registration Success State
6. Assisted Help State

Also create responsive mobile versions.

====================================================
KISANQ CORE CONCEPT
====================================================

KisanQ is a farmer-centric procurement predictability platform.

The goal is to reduce:

- unnecessary waiting
- unnecessary trips
- schedule uncertainty
- queue uncertainty
- procurement status uncertainty

The larger KisanQ platform will eventually help farmers understand:

WHERE should I go?
WHEN should I go?
WHEN should I leave?

The system will use information such as:

- farmer location
- crop
- quantity
- procurement centre
- current queue
- centre capacity
- average processing time
- estimated waiting time

to provide smarter procurement planning.

IMPORTANT:
The login and registration experience should establish the same feeling:

Simple
Trustworthy
Accessible
Farmer-friendly

====================================================
BRANDING
====================================================

Project name:

KisanQ

Logo concept:
Create a simple professional logo combining:

- letter "Q"
- agriculture/leaf/farm element
- subtle queue/connection concept

Do not make the logo overly complicated.

Display:

KisanQ

"Smart Procurement. Better Predictability."

Use the KisanQ name consistently throughout every screen.

====================================================
DESIGN STYLE
====================================================

Create a premium but simple Indian agriculture technology interface.

Visual characteristics:

- clean
- trustworthy
- modern
- farmer-friendly
- government-service inspired
- accessible
- professional
- minimal
- responsive

Do NOT make it look like:

- banking software
- crypto dashboard
- gaming interface
- overly futuristic AI interface

Use:

Primary:
Agriculture Green

Secondary:
Dark Navy

Background:
White / very light green

Success:
Green

Warning:
Amber

Error:
Red

Use:

- white authentication cards
- subtle green accents
- rounded corners
- soft shadows
- clean borders
- readable typography
- large buttons
- clear form labels

====================================================
LANGUAGE SUPPORT
====================================================

The entire authentication module must support:

English
हिन्दी

Place a clearly visible language switcher:

English | हिन्दी

When English is selected, use English throughout the interface.

When Hindi is selected, translate ALL visible interface text into Hindi.

Do NOT randomly mix Hindi and English.

Example:

English:

"Welcome to KisanQ"

"Smart Procurement. Better Predictability."

"Login to continue your procurement journey."

Hindi:

"किसानQ में आपका स्वागत है"

"स्मार्ट खरीद। बेहतर पूर्वानुमान।"

"अपनी खरीद प्रक्रिया जारी रखने के लिए लॉगिन करें।"

