====================================================
8. ASSISTED DIGITAL ACCESS
====================================================

This is an important KisanQ concept.

Do NOT assume every farmer can independently use a smartphone.

Create a small but highly visible:

"Need Help?"

Card.

Title:

"Need help using KisanQ?"

Hindi:

"किसानQ इस्तेमाल करने में मदद चाहिए?"

Options:

1. Assisted Help Desk
2. Call Support
3. IVR
4. SMS Assistance

IVR full form:

Interactive Voice Response

Description:

"Farmers who need help can access KisanQ through assisted support."

Hindi:

"जिन किसानों को डिजिटल सेवा उपयोग करने में सहायता चाहिए, वे सहायता केंद्र, IVR या SMS के माध्यम से सेवा प्राप्त कर सकते हैं।"

Make this feel supportive, not like an error.

