====================================================
15. FUTURE KISANQ JOURNEY
====================================================

Remember that authentication is only the beginning of the larger KisanQ prototype.

After login, the farmer will eventually be able to:

1. Enter crop
2. Enter quantity
3. Provide location
4. Get Smart Centre Recommendation
5. Get Smart Slot Recommendation
6. Receive Virtual Token
7. View Live Queue
8. View Dynamic ETA
9. Receive Leave-Now notification
10. Track Verification
11. Track Quality Check
12. Track Weighing
13. Track Procurement
14. Track Payment
15. Give Feedback

The authentication design should therefore establish:

TRUST
+
SIMPLICITY
+
ACCESSIBILITY
+
PREDICTABILITY

