====================================================

This is a prototype.

Do NOT claim:

- real government authentication
- real Aadhaar integration
- real OTP service
- real government database integration
- real SMS service
- real IVR integration

Use prototype/demo interactions.

The interface can simulate OTP verification for the Figma prototype.

